sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: VM boot, CLI setup, and shutdown
  accDescr: System dependencies are installed during Lima boot with live logs. CLI downloads run afterwards, while SSH and browser SOCKS need only ready infrastructure. Interrupted boot is awaited before setup resumes.
  participant U as User
  participant A as zbox CLI
  participant H as Mac services
  participant V as Lima VM
  U->>A: zbox create
  A->>V: Create stopped VM and stable persona
  opt Protect the first boot with VPN
    U->>A: zbox vpn add
    A->>A: Save VPN intent and guarded NIC configuration
  end
  U->>A: start, agent command, ssh, or socks
  alt VM is stopped
    opt VPN configured
      A->>H: Start guarded gateway and sing-box
      H->>H: Select VLESS or trusted-LAN egress
      A->>A: Verify guarded NIC and DNS
    end
    A->>V: Sync mounts and system-only boot scripts
    A->>V: Boot via Lima
    V->>V: Install missing system dependencies and Node/npm
    V-->>U: Stream current boot journal through zbox
    V-->>A: Boot scripts finished
  else VM already running, including interrupted first boot
    A->>V: Wait for this boot's completion marker
    Note over A,V: Running alone does not mean provisioning finished
  end
  A->>V: Ensure guest helper, credentials, and proxy services
  A->>H: Ensure host policy / SOCKS and reverse SSH tunnels
  A->>V: Check guest proxy readiness
  Note over A,H: Reuse healthy running infrastructure
  alt start or agent command
    A->>V: Install only missing CLIs and rdx, after boot
    V-->>U: Named installation stages and installer output
    A->>V: Start rdx and launch agent with MCP when requested
    A-->>U: Setup complete / agent session
  else ssh or socks
    A-->>U: Open shell or browser tunnel without CLI downloads
  end
  U->>A: zbox stop
  A->>H: Stop host proxy and reverse tunnels
  A->>V: Stop VM and all guest sessions
  A->>H: Stop VPN gateway and client
